                            <td class="recomm"></td>
                        
                        <td class="pre_recomm"></td>
						<td class="rpt_title">항해일지</td>
                        <td class="comment2"></td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="mso-height-source:auto;">
                        <td class="brk"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">흥국증권</font><br/>마건우</td>
                        <td class="ind"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">자동차</font></td>                        
                        
                            <td class="img2">=</td>
                            <td class="recomm">비중확대</td>
                        
                        <td class="pre_recomm">비중확대</td>
						<td class="rpt_title">Physical AI 구현 인프라를 보유한 기업의 시간</td>
                        <td class="comment2"><span class="comment_text">▶</span> 현대자동차그룹에대한 인식의 변화<br/><span class="comment_text">▶</span> Physical AI 밸류체인Checkpoint<br/><span class="comment_text">▶</span> 실적 점검</td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="mso-height-source:auto;">
                        <td class="brk"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">다올투자증권</font><br/>유지웅</td>
                        <td class="ind"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">자동차</font></td>                        
                        
                            <td class="img2">=</td>
                            <td class="recomm">Overweight</td>
                        
                        <td class="pre_recomm">Overweight</td>
						<td class="rpt_title">패닉셀 이후 나타날 반등의 근거</td>
                        <td class="comment2"><span class="comment_text">▶</span> 최근 2주에 걸친 업종 하락<br/><span class="comment_text">▶</span> 반등 국면에서의 종목별 차별화 기대</td>
                    </tr>
                    
                    <tr style="mso-height-source:auto;">
                        <td class="brk"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">메리츠증권</font><br/>김준성,배현서</td>
                        <td class="ind"><font color="rgb(53,91,157)">자동차</font></td>                        
                        
                            <td class="img0">&nbsp;</td>
                            <td class="recomm"></td>
                        
                        <td class="pre_recomm">Overweight</td>
						<td class="rpt_title">Mobility at a glance</td>
                        <td class="comment2"></td>
                    </tr>
                    
